# 📁 Project Structure

```text
titanic-survival-prediction/
│
├── app.py
├── mlpipeline.py
├── pipeline.joblib
├── titanic_model.joblib
├── titanic_scaler.joblib
├── .gitignore
├── README.md
│
└── templates/
    └── index.html
```

### File Description

| File                    | Purpose                                     |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `mlpipeline.py`         | Data preprocessing, training and evaluation |
| `app.py`                | Flask application and prediction            |
| `pipeline.joblib`       | Saved ML pipeline                           |
| `titanic_model.joblib`  | Saved Logistic Regression model             |
| `titanic_scaler.joblib` | Saved StandardScaler                        |
| `templates/index.html`  | Web interface                               |
| `.gitignore`            | Files excluded from Git                     |
| `README.md`             | Project documentation                       |

